Architecture: all
Maintainer: Y700 Linux OS contributors <maintainers@localhost>
Depends: y700-platform, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, wireplumber, bluez
Description: Touch quick settings for the Lenovo Y700 Xfce desktop
